    "Name": "Quickdraw QKD-9G",
    "Details": "The -9G is Technicron's attempt to redefine the unit as a skirmisher. A light engine and an advanced endo-steel chassis allow for many improvements, including much-improved durability. Four targeting computer-assisted medium lasers provide all-around accurate firepower, backing the 'Mech's main armament of Clan Streak SRM racks. The Quickdraw -9G's most audacious feature is speed, with a supercharger and MASC combination allowing the 60-ton ’Mech to reach ludicrous speeds for its size.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_quickdraw"
  },
